 United . While Kortrijk pushed players forward in a desperate search for an equalizer, the visitors' defensive reinforcements, including Maxime Busi , held firm to secure the three points. It was a game of two halves for the hosts, but ultimately, Valencia 's individual brilliance proved to be the deciding factor."
